comments[5]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T21:45:03.972Z","harness:codex","Duplicate check: complete all-status strict-read corpus contained 2,601 items with no omissions, truncation, or continuation; exact searches for eslint-plugin-unicorn 74 found only historical pm-7gxbl8 and closed 2026-08-29 refresh pm-vwuidf, neither owns this newly published compatible release."
  "2026-08-29T21:46:23.071Z","harness:codex","Compatibility evidence: eslint-plugin-unicorn 74.0.0 declares Node >=22 and ESLint >=10.4; this repository declares Node >=22.18 and resolves ESLint 10.9.1. The first strict ESLint run passed with zero warnings, so the major introduces no active rule regressions."
  "2026-08-29T21:56:08.204Z","harness:codex","Gate diagnosis: the first combined lint run used the linked-test default schema sandbox, so repository-static-quality correctly saw zero governed terminal defects and failed closed. The defect-evidence gate passes against the real tracker with 89 governed terminal defects and zero findings. The lint link now explicitly declares tracker context; code/style ESLint, both duplication scans, exact coverage, packed npx/bunx smoke, and audit all passed."
  "2026-08-29T22:09:55.555Z","harness:codex","Final local evidence: eslint-plugin-unicorn 74.0.0 resolves with reviewed registry integrity; strict ESLint, both zero-duplication scans, the entire repository static-quality suite, graph composition, and record integrity pass. Exact coverage passed all 8,124 tests at 60,171/60,171 statements, 45,397/45,397 branches, 12,514/12,514 functions, and 57,941/57,941 lines. The packed local artifact passed all npx and bunx package/bin smokes across 13 packages, and pnpm audit reports no known vulnerabilities."
  "2026-08-29T22:20:07.898Z","harness:codex","Evidence precision correction: the linked command used --audit-level high, so it proves there are no high-or-critical vulnerabilities at that threshold; it does not prove the absence of lower-severity advisories. The registry security-alert census and tracked secret scan are separate evidence surfaces."
learnings[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-29T22:09:55.967Z","harness:codex",Repository-wide linked quality tests must declare pm_context_mode=tracker when their gates intentionally inspect the real PM corpus; schema isolation correctly fails closed because it contains no governed historical evidence.
